{
  "name": "window-scaled-depth",
  "integration": "forescout-rem",
  "description": "REGRESSION LOCK on the split allowance following the search window instead of being a fixed count. Depth is shared by both axes: seven halvings reduce the 0-100 tenths of the risk scale to a single tenth, so a fixed ceiling of twelve would leave exactly five for time whatever the window was. Five suits the 7-day default at about five hours; against sync_strategy=full's 10-year window the same five are a 114-DAY floor, at which point any single-tenth band holding more than 1000 assets caps out and the run reports a shortfall it did not have to have. The allowance is therefore derived: keep halving until a slice is no longer than six hours.\n\nThis scenario runs the SAME truncate-everything estate as truncation-reported but over a ONE-DAY window, where the derivation yields two time halvings rather than five. That makes the numbers a discriminator rather than a description: 6 time-window queries and 4 windows still capped at the limit, against the 62 and 32 a fixed twelve would have produced. 24 search windows in total -- 1 bound-free probe, 2 zero-score halves, 8 queries down the truncated low edge of the risk scale, its 7 complete siblings, and the 6 time windows under the single 0.0-0.0 band.\n\nThe zero-score probe is answered complete on its second call here, which keeps this scenario cheap and focused; zero-score-overflow.json is where that path is exercised properly.",
  "kwargs": {
    "url": "$BASE",
    "api_key": "fixture-key",
    "sync_strategy": "incremental",
    "lookback_days": "1"
  },
  "routes": [
    {
      "name": "truncated-low-band",
      "match": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/data-exchange/v3/rem-asset-search",
        "query_contains": "risk_score_min=0.0"
      },
      "responses": [
        {
          "status": 200,
          "json": {
            "total_hits": 1500,
            "entities": [
              {
                "id": "rem-low-1",
                "hostname": "low-risk-1",
                "ip_addresses": [
                  "10.91.0.1"
                ],
                "mac_addresses": [
                  "00:91:00:00:00:01"
                ],
                "rem_category": "IoT",
                "rem_function": "Badge Reader",
                "risk_score": 0,
                "last_seen": "2026-08-20T08:55:23.777Z"
              },
              {
                "id": "rem-low-2",
                "hostname": "low-risk-2",
                "ip_addresses": [
                  "10.91.0.2"
                ],
                "mac_addresses": [
                  "00:91:00:00:00:02"
                ],
                "rem_category": "IoT",
                "rem_function": "Badge Reader",
                "risk_score": 0,
                "last_seen": "2026-08-20T08:55:23.800Z"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "when_exhausted": "repeat_last"
    },
    {
      "name": "complete-band",
      "match": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/data-exchange/v3/rem-asset-search",
        "query_contains": "risk_score_min"
      },
      "responses": [
        {
          "status": 200,
          "json": {
            "total_hits": 1,
            "entities": [
              {
                "id": "rem-high-1",
                "hostname": "high-risk-1",
                "ip_addresses": [
                  "10.91.1.1"
                ],
                "mac_addresses": [
                  "00:91:00:00:01:01"
                ],
                "rem_category": "OT",
                "rem_function": "PLC",
                "risk_score": 9.9,
                "risk_severity": "Critical",
                "last_seen": "2026-08-20T08:55:22.000Z"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "when_exhausted": "repeat_last"
    },
    {
      "name": "unbanded",
      "match": {
